<title>UK: Schleswig-Holstein sets 250 mln mark 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Schleswig-Holstein sets 250 mln mark 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEINISCHE LANDSCHAFT HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.185   FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K) 10	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON TO 14.JAN.97 OF ONE-MONTH LIBOR</p>
<p>		FLAT</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 617</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
